<Document>
  <name>Northern Lights &amp; Polar Bears 2026 — Caravan Itinerary</name>
  <description><![CDATA[31 days, Sep 13 – Oct 13 2026. 1,286 mi / 2,070 km of driving in 8 legs, plus the overnight VIA Rail run Thompson ↔ Churchill. Overnight pins are campground entrances. Built from the caravan itinerary dated September 7, 2026 — <a href="https://snthor-phd.github.io/polar-bears-2026/">snthor-phd.github.io/polar-bears-2026</a>]]></description>
  <Style id="stop"><IconStyle><color>ff648a1c</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/grn-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.9</scale></LabelStyle></Style>
  <Style id="start"><IconStyle><color>ff648a1c</color><scale>1.2</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/grn-stars.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.9</scale></LabelStyle></Style>
  <Style id="churchill"><IconStyle><color>ff2b8ad9</color><scale>1.3</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/orange-stars.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.9</scale></LabelStyle></Style>
  <Style id="poi"><IconStyle><color>ff8f6134</color><scale>0.8</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/blu-circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.9</scale></LabelStyle></Style>
